config LAYER_OVERLAY_REPORT
    bool "Report the active layer to the host over Raw HID"
    default y
    depends on RAW_HID
    help
      Sends a Raw HID report whenever the layer state changes, and answers
      host queries with the current state. Used by the layer overlay app.

config LAYER_OVERLAY_KEY_REPORT
    bool "Also report pressed key positions"
    default y
    depends on LAYER_OVERLAY_REPORT
    help
      Sends the set of pressed key positions (both halves of a split) on every
      press and release, so the overlay can highlight them. Adds one small
      report per key event, which costs a little battery over Bluetooth.
